        "data_description": {
          "doors": "Door or window sensors. While any is open the light is off. When all are closed again it turns back on, but only inside the on hours.",
          "dry_below": "With a soil moisture sensor, watering is skipped while the soil reads at or above this, and starts (or you get a reminder) when it drops below.",
          "hours": "How long the light stays on each day, counted from the start time. Used only when no crop is picked; a crop sets its own hours for each growth stage.",
          "moisture": "Optional. A soil moisture sensor in the pot or tray. Scheduled watering is skipped while the soil is still wet, and dry soil triggers watering or a reminder.",
          "notify": "Optional. Notify actions, such as your phone, for stage changes, harvest, watering due, dry soil and sowing reminders.",
          "plant": "Search for the crop you are growing. Its light hours and watering follow its growth stage, counted from the sowing date.",
          "planted_on": "The day the seeds were sown or the plants went in. The growth stage is counted from this day.",
          "plug": "The plug, switch or light that powers the grow light.",
          "power": "Optional. If the plug measures its own power, the energy count uses it instead of the light power above.",
          "price": "Optional. Price per kWh, to show what the light costs to run. 0 hides the cost.",
          "resow_days": "Optional. Days between sowings for crops grown in batches, such as radish, lettuce or mung beans. 0 means no reminder.",
          "start": "When the light turns on each day. Watering is due at this time too.",
          "water_days": "Days between waterings when no crop is picked. 0 means no watering schedule.",
          "water_minutes": "How long the pump or valve runs each time it waters.",
          "water_switch": "Optional. A switch for a pump or valve. When set, the helper waters by itself when watering is due; without it, press Watered after watering by hand.",
          "watts": "Optional. The grow light's rated power, used to count its energy. 0 means no energy count unless a power sensor is set."
        },
        "description": "Keep a plug on for set hours each day, pause it while a door is open, and follow a crop's growth stages for light and watering.",
        "title": "Add grow light"
      }
    }
  },
